  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>事情は聞いてる系？
だからあたしに任せれば
ダイジョブ系？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard all about it-ish?
So just leave it to me,
I'll take care of it-ish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よろしくお願いするズラ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, Please Help Me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お、さっそくやってるみたいだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, they're already doing it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>タルロウさん、がんばって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do your best, Tarlow!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とても激しい特訓だったが
お見せ出来ないのが残念だぜ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was a truly fierce training
session, but, unfortunately, we
couldn't show it to you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見せる？誰に？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Show it to who?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、別に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, no one...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ハァ、ハァ……
き、きっそー……
全然ダメズラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haa... Haa... Oh, oh no...
I'm so useless at this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうでもない系？　なんか
後ひとつポイントさえつかめば
一気に花開く系？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not true at all-ish? I think there's just
one little thing you need to get down and
you'll start to bloom just like a flower-ish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当ズラか！？
そのひとつのポイントって
何ズラか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is That Really True!?
So then, what's that
one little thing!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは……タイミング系？
間というか、タイミングを
つかめば、いける系？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think it's...timing-ish? Like, when
to do what move. If you get the
timing down, you'll be great-ish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、それはどうやって
学べばいいズラか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-And How Can
I Learn that!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う～ん、悩む系？
これは一人で教えるより
二人で教えたほうがいい系？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmm, that's difficult-ish? Rather
than one person, it's better to
learn that from two people-ish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273064</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ショックハート！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shocked Heart!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どっかにこのあたし並とは
言わない系だけど、それなりに
踊れる系？がいればいいのに系？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They wouldn't have to be as good
as me-ish, but if I had some-ish? to
dance with me, we could do it-ish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うーん、
また探してこようか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, well... Maybe we
should go look again...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、それなら
&lt;Mel&gt;踊ればいいじゃん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, why not just
dance yourself, &lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？わたし！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Me!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう。
そんなコスチュームなかったっけ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, you. Don't you have
a costume for that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
